  "details": "I and alot of people including event hosts used to use the status to post our Discord tag number so that friends in VRC could easily add us in discord.\nThe new public statuses mean that the world can see that information and it seems a bad idea to have that just out there. \nSo either add the ability to toggle our status to friends only or have some section in our Bios that's reserved for friends only. This way we can share some contact info or more personal information only to ppl we want access to that information.",
